      "body": "## Motivation\n\nThe CUDA images pin `sgl-nvidia-mega` at `d47deb3`, and that commit no longer runs on main. It imports SGLang modules that main has since moved or changed:\n\n- `kernels/ops/attention/dsv4/unified_kv_kernels/env_gate.py`, `kernels/ops/layernorm/mxfp8_epilogue.py`, and `hc_combine` in `kernels/ops/layernorm/mhc.py`, all moved by #45112.\n- `TopKConfig.num_fused_shared_experts`, split by #44912 / #44913.\n\nWith the pinned plugin, `--enable-nvidia-megakernel` fails to build the megakernel on main with `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'sglang.kernels.ops.attention.dsv4.unified_kv_kernels.env_gate'`.\n\nsgl-nvidia-mega `main` already follows these changes: sgl-project/sgl-nvidia-mega#15, sgl-project/sgl-nvidia-mega#16 and sgl-project/sgl-nvidia-mega#18. Its operators resolve at their current locations, falling back to the old ones.\n\n## Modifications\n\nBump `SGL_NVIDIA_MEGA_COMMIT` from `d47deb3` to `3333e4c` (sgl-nvidia-mega `main`) in `docker/Dockerfile` and `docker/Dockerfile.cu134`.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nTested on 4x GB300 with `lmsysorg/sglang:dev-cu13`, SGLang main `a175e39b84`, and sgl-nvidia-mega `3333e4c` on `PYTHONPATH`. DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash was served with the plugin README's command: TP4, DSpark block 5, `--enable-nvidia-megakernel` and the three required env vars.\n\n- The megakernel builds and runs:\n  - `NVIDIA megakernel: active` appears for the target and the DSpark draft spec on all 4 ranks (8 lines).\n  - `draft proposal engaged` appears 108 times during graph capture.\n  - The server log has no errors.\n- GSM8K (sgl-eval 0.1.3, 200 examples, temperature 1.0, top_p 0.95, no thinking, seed 0): 0.975, with error rate 0 and truncated rate 0.\n- bs=1 serving (random-ids 1024/512, 8 prompts): 491.8 tok/s, accept length 3.88.\n- The plugin's own `test/unit` on this SGLang: 148 passed.\n\nWith `d47deb3`, the same server fails at the megakernel build with the `ModuleNotFoundError` above.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A: this PR only moves the plugin pin.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests). (N/A: Docker pin only)\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations). (N/A)\n- [x] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:white_check_mark: [Run #39596904596](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39596904596)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39596904884](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39596904884)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:heavy_minus_sign: **No AMD PR run found for this commit**.<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
